                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As the only occupational therapist in Congress, I know how life-changing OT can be, especially for those facing mental health or substance use challenges.\u00a0\n\nMy new bill expands access to these vital services under Medicare, helping make OTs a stronger part of our mental health response for those in need. We need to use every tool we have to fight this crisis.",
