                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I joined 152 of my House colleagues in filing an amicus brief to challenge the Trump Administration\u2019s illegal and harmful cuts to life-saving NIH research.\n\nThese cuts threaten critical medical breakthroughs and undermine lifesaving public health research.\n\nI\u2019ll always stand up for Western New Yorkers and every American who depends on the life-saving work being done in our universities, hospitals, and research labs.\n\nhttps://t.co/2QBL7XSTuu",
