                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today we cut the ribbon on @UBuffalo's  new Mobile Health Units \u2013 a project that will bring doctors, screenings, and care directly into neighborhoods across Buffalo.\n\nFor too long, inaccessibility has kept too many Western New Yorkers from getting the healthcare they deserve. These mobile units will help break down that barrier, meeting people where they are and delivering lifesaving, affordable care.\n\nAs an occupational therapist, I know firsthand the difference that timely, accessible care can make. Together, we\u2019re building a healthier, more equitable future for Buffalo.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "UBuffalo"
                ],
                "text_tagged_users_ids": [
                    "2326061460"
