                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was proud to stand alongside my colleagues, veterans, and advocates to oppose the Trump administration\u2019s proposed rule that would strip veterans of essential reproductive health care and reinstate a near-total abortion ban at the VA.\n\nWe have an obligation to protect and expand healthcare for all Americans \u2013 especially those who have dedicated their lives to protecting our freedoms.",
