                "text": "860,000 New Yorkers are slated to lose their health care because of Trump and Republicans\u2019 Big, Ugly Bill.\n\nThe GOP owns this shutdown. Cancel the cuts and protect healthcare. https://t.co/RcfdLfwsv5",
