                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Honored to join @DYouville University \u2013 alongside my mother, Mary, a proud D\u2019Youville alum and retired professor \u2013 for an exciting update on the new D\u2019Youville College of Osteopathic Medicine.\n\nAs a D\u2019Youville graduate myself, I know firsthand how this institution changes lives. The new College of Osteopathic Medicine will expand opportunity, advance healthcare education, and strengthen our region for generations to come.\n\nThank you to the entire D\u2019Youville team for your visionary leadership and for continuing to build a healthier, more compassionate future for Western New York.",
