                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "What the Senate has put forward in a backroom deal is a total betrayal of the American people \u2014 one that continues an assault on healthcare in this country.\u00a0\n\nMillions of people will lose their health insurance, and tens of millions more will be forced to pay skyrocketing costs. It\u2019s a bad deal for the people of this country. I will be voting no.",
