                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Now more than ever, we need to keep up the fight to protect the American people's healthcare.\u00a0\n\nToday, I stood alongside my House Democratic Caucus colleagues to demand that Trump and Congressional Republicans extend these critical health care tax credits and keep their hands off our healthcare.\u00a0\n\nWhile they continue to push their failed policies that rip away coverage and raise costs for working families, @HouseDemocrats are fighting back to #CanceltheCuts.",
                "text_lang": "en",
