                "quoted_status_profile_username": "AmDiabetesAssn",
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This National Diabetes Month, we\u2019re reminded just how urgent the fight for affordable, accessible health care truly is.\n\nA staggering 136 million Americans are living with diabetes or pre-diabetes. That\u2019s nearly one in every two people. And every day, the rising cost of health care puts lives at risk. In the richest nation on earth, no one should be forced to choose between paying for life-saving medication and paying their bills.\n\nAs the @AmDiabetesAssn  marks 85 years of dedication to diabetes research, treatment, and advocacy, we honor the progress made and recognize the work still ahead. Together, we can push that progress even further.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1763407982,
                "view_count": 537
