                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Administration is continuing its assault on working people and our healthcare system by arbitrarily capping student loans for degrees it deems \u201cunprofessional.\u201d That list includes nurses, teachers, occupational and physical therapists, mental health workers, and more.\n\nAs this administration and Congressional Republicans continue to hurt students and American families, I\u2019m standing up and fighting back.",
