                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On the House Floor today, I recognized Dr. Allison Brashear, Dean of the @UBuffalo  @Jacobs_Med_UB, upon her election to the National Academy of Medicine.\n\nThis tremendous honor is reserved for those who have advanced the field of medicine, a feat accomplished throughout Dr. Brashear\u2019s three decades of service as a neurologist, researcher, professor, and leader in medicine.\n\nOn behalf of a grateful community and nation, thank you, Dr. Brashear, for your tireless efforts to push the boundaries of medical research while inspiring the next generation of healers.",
